        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun in a Well is an action roguelike where the only way to dodge is to shoot. Jump around using recoil, kill enemies with bullets, destroy them with electricity or burn them to crisp. Manage health and ammo, choose your upgrades, break the game and reach the bottom of the well!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509950/extras/e3cc713fa75eefb2e79caa9addbf4838.poster.avif?t=1763117675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509950/extras/e3cc713fa75eefb2e79caa9addbf4838.webm?t=1763117675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509950/extras/e3cc713fa75eefb2e79caa9addbf4838.mp4?t=1763117675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💣 Dozens of unique upgrades, each with 3 levels and unique abilities, allow you to create your own play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 Choose your weapon out of a large arsenal each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Shoot enemies with bullets or lightning, burn them or get rid of them in other ways to reach the bottom of the well</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Buy passive improvements between runs and beat all the ascension levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Approachable (but not easy!) ~10 minute runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509950/extras/ead440022426d752222cafb6c82e6573.poster.avif?t=1763117675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item